In the Venn diagram:

ξ = {pupils in the class}
G = {pupils who are girls}
S = {pupils who are swimmers}
F = {pupils born on a Friday}

(a) Find n(F ∩ G ∩ S).

(b) A pupil is chosen at random from the class.

Find the probability that the pupil

(i) is a swimmer

(ii) is a boy swimmer born on a Friday.
